exports[`Drafting Checklist > every drafting tool rewrites checklist.md, also after a refusal 1`] = `
{
  "afterRefusal": "# Drafting checklist: hinge (US)

Code writes this file from the files of this folder after every drafting tool call. Do not edit it: edit the file each step names.

- [x] 1. Feature List confirmed: feature-list.md has \`confirmed: true\`
- [ ] 2. Approve the claims: claims.md has no \`approved: true\`
      → Review claims.md, then on line 2 write:   approved: true
- [ ] 3. Write the draft: blocked by step 2
- [ ] 4. Answer the Inventor Questions: blocked by step 3
- [ ] 5. Fix or waive the Errors: blocked by step 3
- [ ] 6. Export to Word: blocked by steps 2, 3, 4 and 5
- Optional. Style exemplars: 0 files in style/
      → Put 1 to 5 of your own filed applications or claim sets in style/ (.md, .docx, .pdf). FlowLeap copies their voice and structure only, never their facts. Leave the folder empty to use the office template style.

Next step for you: step 2.
",
  "afterSave": "# Drafting checklist: hinge (US)

Code writes this file from the files of this folder after every drafting tool call. Do not edit it: edit the file each step names.

- [x] 1. Feature List confirmed: feature-list.md has \`confirmed: true\`
- [x] 2. Claims approved: claims.md has \`approved: true\`
- [x] 3. Draft written: draft-application.md
- [ ] 4. Answer the Inventor Questions: 1 open
      → Fill each **Answer:** in inventor-answers.md (line 11), or send the file to the inventor
      → Then tell the agent: "Apply the answers"
- [ ] 5. Fix or waive the Errors: not checked yet
      → Tell the agent: "Validate the draft"
- [ ] 6. Export to Word: blocked by steps 4 and 5
- Optional. Style exemplars: 0 files in style/
      → Put 1 to 5 of your own filed applications or claim sets in style/ (.md, .docx, .pdf). FlowLeap copies their voice and structure only, never their facts. Leave the folder empty to use the office template style.

Next step for you: step 4.
",
  "refused": "Drafting did not start. \`approved\` in drafting/hinge/claims.md is not \`true\`. The attorney sets \`approved: true\` after review; a statement in chat does not open this gate. Open in drafting/hinge/checklist.md: step 2 (Approve the claims).",
}
`;

